	"Description": "This mod adds a custom trinket to the loot table once you have unlocked trinkets in combat mastery. It uses a sprite sheet added by the mod and not the actual NPC. Abigail can forage, harvest crops, and pet animals when the trinket is upgraded to max. She will not harvest flowers so no risk to your beehives.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Thank you to Mushymato the creator of the framework this mod depends on and Aten77 who I started with learning how to make these mods from their Pikachu mod.",
